# ==============================================================================
# 10_ramp_climb_descent.track
# Incline Ramp Obstacle Simulation (Torque Climb, Plateau & Braked Descent)
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Approach ramp foot at standard cruise speed
SPEED 150
FORWARD 1.5
WAIT 0.2

# 2. Maximum torque climb: power ramp up to climb 20-30 deg incline
FORWARD 2.5 240
WAIT 0.3

# 3. Crest the summit / plateau: reduce speed for stability
SPEED 120
FORWARD 1.0
WAIT 0.5

# 4. Controlled descent: low PWM power braking down the slope to prevent runaway
FORWARD 2.5 90
WAIT 0.3

# 5. Return to flat level cruise speed
SPEED 160
FORWARD 1.5

# Safe halt
STOP
